# Accuenergy AcuRev 1310.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Accuenergy AcuRev 1310 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: accuenergy-acurev-1310-modbus-manual.pdf (Version 1.2.10, Revised April 2026)
# | - Applies to AcuRev 1312, 1313, 1314 (DIN-rail 3-phase power meter).
# | - FC03 (Read Holding Registers) for all measurement registers.
# | - All addresses are raw protocol addresses (0x2000 = 8192 decimal).
# | - Real-time: Float (IEEE 754, 2 registers, Big-Endian MSW first); values in SI units.
# | - Energy (real-time bank): Dword (u32, 2 registers, Big-Endian); real = Rx/100 → scale=0.01 kWh.
# | - Energy (TOU bank at 0x900H): Dword (u32, 2 registers); real = Rx/100 → scale=0.01 kWh.
# | - Demands: Float, separate bank at 0x1208H (4616 decimal).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=19200, 8N1/E1/O1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Accuenergy
@model=AcuRev 1310
@vendor_website=accuenergy.com
@description=3-phase DIN-rail power meter — V/I/P/Q/S/PF/phase angles (float SI), power/current demands, energy (Dword Rx/100 kWh) in real-time 0x2046 and TOU 0x900 banks (FC03, Big-Endian).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/accuenergy-acurev-1310.toml; Source: accuenergy-acurev-1310-modbus-manual.pdf (Version 1.2.10, Revised April 2026). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

